{"id":879845,"title":"22｜验证向量化模型","content":"通过测试Dify接入的embedding模型，验证其在智能对话中的应用效果。首先确认已接入Ollama部署的qwen3模型并测试其基本功能，结果显示该模型正常运行。接着创建知识库并上传课程信息文档，此文档包含课程名称、特色、适合人群及收获等内容。系统自动将文档分割为三个部分：适用人群、课程收获和课程特色。配置过程中采用默认设置，包括Xinference提供的base bge-reranker-base作为Embedding模型，并启用rerank模型。处理完成后，通过询问智能体关于“适合人群”的问题来检验知识库的有效性，智能体准确回答了文档中列出的目标群体。进一步提问“课程特色”，智能体同样给出了正确答案，并且展示了高匹配度（权重0.96）。这表明Dify平台成功集成了向量化模型，并能够有效支持基于文档的知识检索与问答。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401098,"user_name":"峻萧Peyton","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3883792,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"FCAC0C786F49C9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3b/43/10/1c2731df.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1750692540,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145916,"content":"课程配套资料：\nhttps:&#47;&#47;jcn7i8etm68y.feishu.cn&#47;wiki&#47;Czcnwew2uiM2VrkMSCLcu3nenUb 密码：918V795#","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1751853915,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":401098,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"这个课程信息的文档去那里领取呢？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668208,"discussion_content":"课程配套资料：\nhttps://jcn7i8etm68y.feishu.cn/wiki/Czcnwew2uiM2VrkMSCLcu3nenUb 密码：918V795#","content_length":83,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1751853916,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401099,"user_name":"峻萧Peyton","can_delete":false,"pr